{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U{’<U